## Phase 18 getUser response Fastjson decoder continuation

- Recorded: 2026-10-24 06:55 UTC
- Code revision: `41854b80`
- Fixture: `fixtures/producer/core.json`, SHA-256
  `ac4d435472279c6cdfefadf2811422359bc927223733c3521484c1c533d31f36`

The Core API audit found `getUser` still decoded its nullable `UserInfo` body
through generic Serde. It now calls `UserInfo::java_decode_nullable`, matching
the Java Fastjson path while preserving absent-body and JSON-null results. The
invoked `getUser` oracle adds trailing-text and second-document cases after
raw U+001A; Java returns the same populated DTO for both.

